        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Keiser%2C_Arkansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Keiser transitioned from a logging outpost and rail stop into an agrarian community after the local forests were cleared.",
